description=Your rules and guides stop being a Discord link nobody opens and become a first-class, in-game window with a side menu and formatted text. Content lives in one folder on the server and is [b]streamed live[/b] to players: edit it and everyone sees the new version the next time they open the window. Built for dedicated / multiplayer servers — the client never touches the disk, it only receives text over the network.
